## 1. Your Role

Act as a senior full-stack engineer, backend architect, database engineer, security specialist, and UI/UX designer.

You are working on my existing **Zamzam e-commerce project**. Inspect the current repository, understand its architecture, and implement the complete product and order management system. Do not merely generate a plan, mockup, or example code. Modify and integrate the actual application.

