## 2. Business Requirements

Zamzam is an online store selling beauty, household, personal-care, and other consumer products.

The customer storefront must support browsing and purchasing products without requiring customers to create accounts.

The admin panel must support authenticated administrators who can:

- View product statistics and store activity.
- Add new products.
- Upload product images to Cloudinary.
- Edit existing products and prices.
- Delete or archive products safely.
- Manage inventory and stock.
- Control featured, best-selling, trending, and new-arrival labels.
- View and manage customer orders.
- Update order statuses.
- View customer shipping details.
- Search, filter, and paginate products and orders.
- Refresh data from the real backend.

All product and order operations must persist in the real database.

